				Time="2011-06-04T10:35:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ｔ03ｒ0201でのイベント後
・建物の外にでるとイベント開始</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T10:40:35" />
		</CommentCell>
